# owl-inverse-functional-property: a small runnable case for EYE RPO rules.
# Source: https://eyereasoner.github.io/eye/reasoning/rpo/owl-InverseFunctionalProperty.n3
# Rules: MIT, Jos De Roo; sample data added for this example.

@prefix : <http://example.org/>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#>.
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#>.

# Sample data
:account a owl:InverseFunctionalProperty. :alice :account :shared. :aliceAlias :account :shared.

# Inference rules
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.

{?P a owl:InverseFunctionalProperty. ?X ?P ?O. ?Y ?P ?O} => {?X owl:sameAs ?Y}.
{?P a owl:InverseFunctionalProperty. ?X ?P ?O. ?Y ?P ?O. ?X owl:differentFrom ?Y} => false.
